#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1437 expect=noViolation domain=AC
#note "Guard branch: no ACPARMCD='CAGTCAT' record exists -- 'RADIOLOGICAL/NUCLEAR' only appears as the ACVAL of a different parameter (RNASRC), so the challenge agent category was never declared and the CIRNRIND parameter is not expected -> no violation. Pins that the ACPARMCD half of the CAGTCAT filter is load-bearing."
#library standard=sendig version=ar-1-0
dataset AC label="Challenge Agent Characterization"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col ACSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col ACPARMCD type=Char label="Challenge Agent Parameter Short Name"
col ACPARM   type=Char label="Challenge Agent Parameter"
col ACVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
S1 | AC | 1 | RNASRC   | Rad/Nuc Agent Source         | RADIOLOGICAL/NUCLEAR
